   "date": "2013-02-05T21:04:27Z",
   "subject": "Re: ggsave always opens a graphics window on Mac OS",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Interesting - it looks like ggsave&#39;s call to par(&quot;din&quot;), to find the current device dimensions, is what makes the window open. I don&#39;t know of a way around this, though.<div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n-Winston</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
